      "value": "@{5a9b3ad0f5e0532e3ea468be|full_name} I thought im the only one but it seems not. I also have sometimes randomly these login loops on iOS, clearing cache, closing safari sometimes helps but not all the time, most of the time it just get into the loop again. \n\nWhat I noticed is that this mostly happens if you have iCloud Private Relay turned on, when I turn off iCloud Private Relay then it works fine, no loop.",
