      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I *think* I hit this yesterday on my Phone using Safari over cellular. At the time, I thought it was just because I was also logged in to the VRChat client on my VRPC. - Now I'm not sure.\n\nWhat I experienced played out like @{5a9b3ad0f5e0532e3ea468be|full_name} outlines above in \"Process\". But I didn't check the Console, so I can't confirm any error messages.",
